title: "HindiTree: An open-access tool for Hindi syntax trees"
abstract: >-
  An open-access web application for drawing, parsing and teaching
  constituency trees for Hindi, with kāraka analysis and a Hindi Lab for
  building arguments from acceptability judgements.
